  ✓ %LOCALAPPDATA%\Apocrypha pre-exists since 2026-07-14 ⊗ foreign.state :
      secrets\online-learning-capability.txt + security\acl-backups\{4 dated dirs}
      + worker-stdout.log @2026-09-08  ⇒ another Apocrypha component owns that root
  ✗ first install put apocrypha-desktop.exe + uninstall.exe INTO that root
  ✓ backed up 13 files before uninstalling ; uninstaller removed only its own two
    ; all 11 foreign files verified byte-identical after ⇒ ¬ harm.done
  ✓ fix := productName "Apocrypha" → "Apocrypha Desktop" ⇒ install root %LOCALAPPDATA%\Apocrypha Desktop
    ; app.windows[0].title stays "Apocrypha" ⇒ window unchanged for the person
  I> N! revert productName ← the folder name is load-bearing, ¬ cosmetic
  ✓ second finding : SecureStore::new created %LOCALAPPDATA%\Apocky\Apocrypha at startup
    ⇒ opening.app ∧ ¬ sign-in still left a folder ; fix := create-on-first-write
    ; test store::opening_the_store_writes_nothing_until_something_is_saved

